            "text": "Lower mortgage financing costs, higher bank housing loans, stronger economic activity, reduced labour market slack, rising realised housing costs, falling developer inventory, tighter supply slack, and growing non-resident population all support sales. These factors reflect improved affordability, credit availability, income growth, and constrained supply relative to demand.",
